                            <span>12 min read</span>
                        </div>
                        <h2>CVE-2026-46333 in Kubernetes: Unset Seccomp Exposed pidfd_getfd, RuntimeDefault Blocked It</h2>
                        <p>We tested the Linux __ptrace_may_access bug in Kubernetes with a bounded fd-theft harness. EKS Auto Mode on Bottlerocket reproduced controlled fd theft when seccomp was unset; RuntimeDefault blocked pidfd_getfd; PSS Baseline did not fix unset seccomp; and PSS Restricted blocked both pidfd_getfd and the setuid open.</p>
