                        <h2>Fragnesia CVE-2026-46300 in Kubernetes: What EKS, Talos, and Seccomp Change</h2>
                        <p>Fragnesia is a Dirty Frag-family Linux kernel issue in ESP-in-TCP. We tested the Kubernetes reachability question on kind, Talos, and EKS AL2023: RuntimeDefault and PSS blocked user namespace creation, and the Talos and EKS kernels we inspected did not expose ESP-in-TCP.</p>
